<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#Action> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Actions are a future measure that will maintain and/or modify a risk. In the HSE, an action is a future measure to further reduce either the likelihood or impact of a risk."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#Action> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Action"@en .
