<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#ActionOwner> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "in order to monitor the action one person must have lead responsibility."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#ActionOwner> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Action owner"@en .
