<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#AvoidOrTerminate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Avoid/Terminate it completely e.g. do not proceed with the planned activity."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#AvoidOrTerminate> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Avoid/terminate"@en .
