<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#CorrectiveControl> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Corrective controls are designed to correct errors or undesirable events which have occurred and will prevent further occurrences."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#CorrectiveControl> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Corrective control"@en .
