<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#CurrentRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Current risk is the level of risk after both the existing controls and actions are considered at the point in time the risk is being assessed"@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#CurrentRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Current risk"@en .
