<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#DetectiveControl> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Detective controls are designed to search for and identify errors or undesirable events after they have occurred so that corrective actions can be taken."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#DetectiveControl> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Detective control"@en .
