<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#DirectiveControl> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Directive controls give direction. These can be, for example, statutory obligations, regulatory standards including professional standards, or other organisational requirements or instructions, many of which are converted into policies, procedures, circulars, standard operating procedures and training."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#DirectiveControl> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Directive control"@en .
# 
