<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#ExternalAssuranceProviders> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "assurance from external independent assurance providers such as Regulators."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#ExternalAssuranceProviders> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "External Assurance providers"@en .
# 
# https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#FirstLineOfDefence
