<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#InherentRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Inherent risk in the HSE is the level of risk before consideration of control and/or action measures."@en .
<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#InherentRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Inherent risk"@en .
