<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/HSE-ERM-ControlOntology#TransferRisk> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Transfer the risk e.g. to an identified individual or unit, that has been communicated to and notified, where many of the actions identified as required to mitigate are better managed and are within their span of control."@en .
