<https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/NIOSH-ControlOntology#EngineeringControl> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Engineering controls reduce exposure by preventing hazards from coming into contact with workers. They still allow workers to do their jobs, though."@en .
